{"id":"675f186aa60d7fbc","group":"67","path":"67/67-thm-local-reflection-consistency.md","title":"Sigma-One Soundness Gives Consistent Local Reflection","display":"thm-local-reflection-consistency — Sigma-One Soundness Gives Consistent Local Reflection","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Aspects of Incompleteness Lindstrom","book_abbrev":"67","label":"67-thm-local-reflection-consistency","aliases":["67-thm-local-reflection-consistency"],"display":"thm-local-reflection-consistency — Sigma-One Soundness Gives Consistent Local Reflection","depends_on":["[[67-df-local-reflection]]","[[67-df-sigma1-sound]]","[[67-df-consistent]]","[[67-thm-reflection-hierarchy]]","[[67-df-PA]]","[[67-thm-pi1-truth-conservativity]]","[[67-df-iterated-consistency]]"],"source_edition":"Cambridge/ASL 2016 reprint of 1997 edition","verification_status":"source-statement-checked","eligible_as_verified_dependency":false,"source_chapter":4,"source_label":"consequence of Theorems 4–5","source_printed_pages":"55–57","source_pdf_pages":"66–68","source_proof_status":"已核对来源依赖并给出后果转移推导；完整基础证明限制继承 Theorem 4.5"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Aspects of Incompleteness Lindstrom"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"67"},{"key":"label","html":"67-thm-local-reflection-consistency"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>67-thm-local-reflection-consistency</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-local-reflection-consistency — Sigma-One Soundness Gives Consistent Local Reflection"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"bfe810351301dc7b\" href=\"?note=bfe810351301dc7b\" title=\"67-df-local-reflection\">67-df-local-reflection</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"b0667bf165ad62df\" href=\"?note=b0667bf165ad62df\" title=\"67-df-sigma1-sound\">67-df-sigma1-sound</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"9f0e08fd1022847c\" href=\"?note=9f0e08fd1022847c\" title=\"67-df-consistent\">67-df-consistent</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"63d809770775f636\" href=\"?note=63d809770775f636\" title=\"67-thm-reflection-hierarchy\">67-thm-reflection-hierarchy</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"cd051851df5d2aa2\" href=\"?note=cd051851df5d2aa2\" title=\"67-df-PA\">67-df-PA</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"c99ab4beea350378\" href=\"?note=c99ab4beea350378\" title=\"67-thm-pi1-truth-conservativity\">67-thm-pi1-truth-conservativity</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"f9e2ecde3df48a4b\" href=\"?note=f9e2ecde3df48a4b\" title=\"67-df-iterated-consistency\">67-df-iterated-consistency</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_edition","html":"Cambridge/ASL 2016 reprint of 1997 edition"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"source-statement-checked"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"false"},{"key":"source_chapter","html":"4"},{"key":"source_label","html":"consequence of Theorems 4–5"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"55–57"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"66–68"},{"key":"source_proof_status","html":"已核对来源依赖并给出后果转移推导；完整基础证明限制继承 Theorem 4.5"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\\supseteq\\mathrm{PA}\">\\(T\\supseteq\\mathrm{PA}\\)</span> 是原始递归呈示，采用固定标准证明算术化和局部反思句集 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{RFN}_{\\mathrm{loc}}(T)\">\\(\\mathrm{RFN}_{\\mathrm{loc}}(T)\\)</span>（<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"bfe810351301dc7b\" href=\"?note=bfe810351301dc7b\" title=\"67-df-local-reflection\">67-df-local-reflection</a>）。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Sound}_{\\Sigma_1}(T)\">\\(\\mathrm{Sound}_{\\Sigma_1}(T)\\)</span> 取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"b0667bf165ad62df\" href=\"?note=b0667bf165ad62df\" title=\"67-df-sigma1-sound\">67-df-sigma1-sound</a>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Con}^{\\mathrm{meta}}\">\\(\\mathrm{Con}^{\\mathrm{meta}}\\)</span> 是 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-10\" data-note=\"9f0e08fd1022847c\" href=\"?note=9f0e08fd1022847c\" title=\"67-df-consistent\">67-df-consistent</a> 的外部一致性谓词。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Sound}_{\\Sigma_1}(T)\n\\Longrightarrow\n\\mathrm{Con}^{\\mathrm{meta}}\\bigl(T\\cup\\mathrm{RFN}_{\\mathrm{loc}}(T)\\bigr).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{Sound}_{\\Sigma_1}(T)\n\\Longrightarrow\n\\mathrm{Con}^{\\mathrm{meta}}\\bigl(T\\cup\\mathrm{RFN}_{\\mathrm{loc}}(T)\\bigr).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>这是原书 Theorems 4–5 的直接推论，比旧稿要求标准模型中全部定理为真更贴近书中假设。对有限迭代作归纳：由 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-11\" data-note=\"c99ab4beea350378\" href=\"?note=c99ab4beea350378\" title=\"67-thm-pi1-truth-conservativity\">67-thm-pi1-truth-conservativity</a>，给 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma_1\">\\(\\Sigma_1\\)</span> 可靠理论加入一个真的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Pi_1\">\\(\\Pi_1\\)</span> 句仍为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma_1\">\\(\\Sigma_1\\)</span> 保守，因而仍 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma_1\">\\(\\Sigma_1\\)</span> 可靠。基步 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"C_1(T)\">\\(C_1(T)\\)</span> 由 T 的一致性为真；若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"C_n(T)\">\\(C_n(T)\\)</span> 真，则 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T+C_n(T)\">\\(T+C_n(T)\\)</span> 仍 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma_1\">\\(\\Sigma_1\\)</span> 可靠且一致，故 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"C_{n+1}(T)\">\\(C_{n+1}(T)\\)</span> 真。于是每个有限一致性迭代为真；若局部反思扩张不一致，其 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Pi_1\">\\(\\Pi_1\\)</span> 后果 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\bot\">\\(\\bot\\)</span> 经 Theorem 5 转移到 PA 加这些真实迭代，矛盾。</p>\n<p>这里没有声称 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma_1\">\\(\\Sigma_1\\)</span> 可靠性使全部反思实例在标准模型为真。T 可以有别的复杂度的假定理；一致性证明使用后果刻画。单独一致性不够，例如一致的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{PA}+\\neg\\mathrm{Con}_{\\mathrm{PA}}\">\\(\\mathrm{PA}+\\neg\\mathrm{Con}_{\\mathrm{PA}}\\)</span> 与自身局部反思中的一致性实例冲突。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"67-df-local-reflection","status":"resolved","id":"bfe810351301dc7b","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[67-df-local-reflection]]","embed":false},{"target":"67-df-sigma1-sound","status":"resolved","id":"b0667bf165ad62df","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[67-df-sigma1-sound]]","embed":false},{"target":"67-df-consistent","status":"resolved","id":"9f0e08fd1022847c","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[67-df-consistent]]","embed":false},{"target":"67-thm-reflection-hierarchy","status":"resolved","id":"63d809770775f636","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[67-thm-reflection-hierarchy]]","embed":false},{"target":"67-df-PA","status":"resolved","id":"cd051851df5d2aa2","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[67-df-PA]]","embed":false},{"target":"67-thm-pi1-truth-conservativity","status":"resolved","id":"c99ab4beea350378","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[67-thm-pi1-truth-conservativity]]","embed":false},{"target":"67-df-iterated-consistency","status":"resolved","id":"f9e2ecde3df48a4b","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[67-df-iterated-consistency]]","embed":false},{"target":"67-df-local-reflection","status":"resolved","id":"bfe810351301dc7b","anchor":"ref-8","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$T\\supseteq\\mathrm{PA}$ 是原始递归呈示，采用固定标准证明算术化和局部反思句集 $\\mathrm{RFN}_{\\mathrm{loc}}(T)$（[[67-df-local-reflection]]）。","embed":false},{"target":"67-df-sigma1-sound","status":"resolved","id":"b0667bf165ad62df","anchor":"ref-9","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Sound}_{\\Sigma_1}(T)$ 取 [[67-df-sigma1-sound]]；$\\mathrm{Con}^{\\mathrm{meta}}$ 是 [[67-df-consistent]] 的外部一致性谓词。","embed":false},{"target":"67-df-consistent","status":"resolved","id":"9f0e08fd1022847c","anchor":"ref-10","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Sound}_{\\Sigma_1}(T)$ 取 [[67-df-sigma1-sound]]；$\\mathrm{Con}^{\\mathrm{meta}}$ 是 [[67-df-consistent]] 的外部一致性谓词。","embed":false},{"target":"67-thm-pi1-truth-conservativity","status":"resolved","id":"c99ab4beea350378","anchor":"ref-11","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Remark]","excerpt":"这是原书 Theorems 4–5 的直接推论，比旧稿要求标准模型中全部定理为真更贴近书中假设。对有限迭代作归纳：由 [[67-thm-pi1-truth-conservativity]]，给 $\\Sigma_1$ 可靠理论加入一个真的 $\\Pi_1$ 句仍为 $\\Sigma_1$ 保守，因而仍 $\\Sigma_1$ 可靠。基步 $C_1(T)$ 由 T 的一致性为真；若 $C_n(T)$ 真，则 $T+C_n(T)$ 仍 $\\Sigma_1$ 可靠且一致，故 $C_{n+1}(T)$ 真。于是每个有限一致性迭代为真；若局部反思扩张不一致，其 $\\Pi_1$ 后果 $\\bot$ 经 Theorem 5 转移到 PA 加这些真实迭代，矛盾。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"T\\supseteq\\mathrm{PA}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{RFN}_{\\mathrm{loc}}(T)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Sound}_{\\Sigma_1}(T)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Con}^{\\mathrm{meta}}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Sound}_{\\Sigma_1}(T)\n\\Longrightarrow\n\\mathrm{Con}^{\\mathrm{meta}}\\bigl(T\\cup\\mathrm{RFN}_{\\mathrm{loc}}(T)\\bigr).","display":true},{"tex":"\\Sigma_1","display":false},{"tex":"\\Pi_1","display":false},{"tex":"\\Sigma_1","display":false},{"tex":"\\Sigma_1","display":false},{"tex":"C_1(T)","display":false},{"tex":"C_n(T)","display":false},{"tex":"T+C_n(T)","display":false},{"tex":"\\Sigma_1","display":false},{"tex":"C_{n+1}(T)","display":false},{"tex":"\\Pi_1","display":false},{"tex":"\\bot","display":false},{"tex":"\\Sigma_1","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{PA}+\\neg\\mathrm{Con}_{\\mathrm{PA}}","display":false}],"bytes":2378,"backlinks":[{"id":"aceae1bb446510ab","anchor":"ref-148","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../67-thm-local-reflection-consistency]]"}],"outgoing":["bfe810351301dc7b","b0667bf165ad62df","9f0e08fd1022847c","63d809770775f636","cd051851df5d2aa2","c99ab4beea350378","f9e2ecde3df48a4b"]}